    <item>
      <title>From Engineer to Founder: Lessons from Raising $120k</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/posts/engineer-to-founder/</link>
      <pubDate>Fri, 29 Aug 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/posts/engineer-to-founder/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h1 id=&#34;from-engineer-to-founder-lessons-from-raising-120k&#34;&gt;&#xA;  From Engineer to Founder: Lessons from Raising $120k&#xA;  &lt;a class=&#34;heading-link&#34; href=&#34;#from-engineer-to-founder-lessons-from-raising-120k&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;i class=&#34;fa-solid fa-link&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; title=&#34;Link to heading&#34;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&#xA;    &lt;span class=&#34;sr-only&#34;&gt;Link to heading&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Recently, my team and I successfully raised $120k in pre-seed funding at a ~$1M valuation through the &lt;a href=&#34;https://hub.antler.co/&#34;  class=&#34;external-link&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;Antler VN8 Cohort&lt;/a&gt; for &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.shipsenla.com/&#34;  class=&#34;external-link&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;SENLA&lt;/a&gt; for logistics providers.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;This journey from embedded systems engineer to technical co-founder taught me several lessons worth sharing.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;building-beyond-your-comfort-zone&#34;&gt;&#xA;  Building Beyond Your Comfort Zone&#xA;  &lt;a class=&#34;heading-link&#34; href=&#34;#building-beyond-your-comfort-zone&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;i class=&#34;fa-solid fa-link&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; title=&#34;Link to heading&#34;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&#xA;    &lt;span class=&#34;sr-only&#34;&gt;Link to heading&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Transitioning from embedded C++ development in aerospace to full-stack web applications for logistics wasn&amp;rsquo;t straightforward. The past year involved:&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title> How a classroom in Vietnam changed my life</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/posts/vietnam-hearts/</link>
      <pubDate>Sun, 10 Aug 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/posts/vietnam-hearts/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h1 id=&#34;how-a-classroom-in-vietnam-changed-my-life&#34;&gt;&#xA;  How a Classroom in Vietnam Changed My Life&#xA;  &lt;a class=&#34;heading-link&#34; href=&#34;#how-a-classroom-in-vietnam-changed-my-life&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;i class=&#34;fa-solid fa-link&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; title=&#34;Link to heading&#34;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&#xA;    &lt;span class=&#34;sr-only&#34;&gt;Link to heading&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;div style=&#34;display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 2.5em; margin: 3em 0;&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;figure style=&#34;flex: 1 1 400px; text-align: center;&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/images/vh-first-class.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;Vietnam Hearts Classroom&#34; style=&#34;width:100%; max-width:500px; border-radius: 18px; box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.12);&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;the-first-day-i-almost-quit&#34;&gt;&#xA;  The First Day I Almost Quit&#xA;  &lt;a class=&#34;heading-link&#34; href=&#34;#the-first-day-i-almost-quit&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;i class=&#34;fa-solid fa-link&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; title=&#34;Link to heading&#34;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&#xA;    &lt;span class=&#34;sr-only&#34;&gt;Link to heading&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;When I first walked into that classroom in Vietnam, I barely knew a word of Vietnamese and had never taught before. My first lesson was a disaster—kids talking over me, no one paying attention, and me not understanding a thing.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Building digital license plates for drones at 24</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/posts/digital-license-plates/</link>
      <pubDate>Fri, 01 Aug 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/posts/digital-license-plates/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h1 id=&#34;it-was-probably-the-biggest-professional-challenge-of-my-career-all-as-junior-engineer&#34;&gt;&#xA;  It was probably the biggest professional challenge of my career, all as junior engineer.&#xA;  &lt;a class=&#34;heading-link&#34; href=&#34;#it-was-probably-the-biggest-professional-challenge-of-my-career-all-as-junior-engineer&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;i class=&#34;fa-solid fa-link&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; title=&#34;Link to heading&#34;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&#xA;    &lt;span class=&#34;sr-only&#34;&gt;Link to heading&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;In 2022, I took on a project that would define much of my year: building &lt;strong&gt;Remote ID&lt;/strong&gt; for our drones. For those unfamiliar, Remote ID is the FAA’s new requirement—basically a digital license plate that broadcasts a drone’s identity and location in real-time. Without it, our entire fleet would be grounded. No worries&amp;hellip; At that time I was still figuring out how a 401k worked.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
